  unitName: Lapis Wing Sae
  unitId: 820044
  unitNumber: 8034
  description: The pint-sized aquatic hybrid from beyond the abyss, overseer of the
    deepest depths beneath the ocean. Her small stature belies her tyrannical personality,
    a reuslt of centuries of being alone with nobody but her most loyal servants.
    Ages of being virtually unmatched in power in her realm spurred her to invade
    the surface world. Her conquest went on swiftly as nobody took her seriously,
    but she was eventually defeated when she took on the more powerful gods. Sacrificing
    a part of her powers and adamantly refusing defeat, she is now doing everything
    she can to regain her lost glory.
  summonDesc: I can't believe that I'm pairing up with lowly being like you! Just
    call me queen and we're even.
  fusionDesc: I'll take whatever you have to offer... you will know true terror once
    my powers return
